---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>DALC Master Plan | {siteConfig.name}</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans">
    <Header />

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex-grow">
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-medium mb-6 inline-block">
        ← Back to Portfolio
      </a>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">
        Driftless Area Land Conservancy Master Plan
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Architected a multi-criteria spatial decision framework using ArcGIS Pro and high-resolution LiDAR data to target capital allocation, ecological restoration, and land protection strategies across a <strong class="text-emerald-400">245-acre nature preserve</strong> in Southwestern Wisconsin's Driftless Area.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-emerald-400">Technical Stack & Methods</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>• <strong>GIS Architecture:</strong> ArcGIS Pro, AGOL, QGIS</li>
            <li>• <strong>Data Datasets:</strong> USGS LiDAR DEMs, 1m Canopy Models, SSURGO Soil Series</li>
            <li>• <strong>Spatial Framework:</strong> Multi-Criteria Evaluation (MCE) Modeling</li>
            <li>• <strong>Core Indices:</strong> Restoration Priority Index (RPI) & Protection Priority Index (PPI)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-emerald-400">Core Deliverables</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>• MCE spatial model targeting invasive removal and oak savanna restoration</li>
            <li>• Flow accumulation and slope steepness erosion risk mapping</li>
            <li>• Comprehensive Property Management Plan with cartographic maps</li>
            <li>• Executive priority matrix presented to conservancy leadership</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="my-8">
        <a 
          href="https://github.com/arikwaldinger" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors"
        >
          View Spatial Project Repository
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
